  Title: Changing when you eat dramatically reduced Crohn’s disease symptoms
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/02/260211204204.htm
  category: research
  importance: 80
  ai_summary: "A study reveals that time-restricted feeding significantly reduced Crohn's disease symptoms, including disease activity and abdominal discomfort, suggesting a dietary approach to managing this chronic condition."
  
  Title: One simple daily change that could slash depression risk
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/02/260211073043.htm
  category: research
  importance: 75
  ai_summary: "A Dutch study indicates that replacing just one hour of television viewing daily with other activities can lower the risk of developing depression, particularly in middle age, highlighting the importance of lifestyle factors for mental well-being."
  
  Title: This kefir and fiber combo beat omega-3 in slashing inflammation
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/02/260211073037.htm
  category: research
  importance: 70
  ai_summary: "Research shows that a combination of kefir and prebiotic fiber was more effective than omega-3 supplements alone in reducing inflammation, suggesting a synergistic effect of these dietary components."
   
  Title: Blockbuster weight loss drugs like Ozempic deliver big results but face big questions
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/02/260211073033.htm
  category: research
  importance: 65
  ai_summary: "Reviews of weight loss drugs like Ozempic confirm their effectiveness in promoting significant weight loss; however, concerns remain regarding long-term safety and the prevalence of side effects."

